{% comment %}
  Repository card.

  Upstream al-folio renders these through github-readme-stats, but the public
  demo instance it points at (github-readme-stats.vercel.app) is paused and
  answers 503, so every card was a broken image. These use GitHub's own
  OpenGraph card service instead: same information, served by GitHub, with no
  third-party deployment to go down.

  To go back to github-readme-stats, self-host it and set
  `external_services.github_readme_stats_url` in _config.yml.
{% endcomment %}

<div class="repo p-2 text-center">
  <a href="https://github.com/{{ include.repository }}">
    <img
      class="w-100 rounded"
      loading="lazy"
      alt="{{ include.repository }} on GitHub"
      src="https://opengraph.githubassets.com/1/{{ include.repository }}"
    >
  </a>
</div>
